        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Katunisietab Hosea ko kalewenetab ole namdogei Jehovah ak Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ng’olyotab Jehovah ne kinyonji Hosea weritab Beri, eng’ betusiekab Usia, Jotam, Ahas, ak Hesekia, che ki laitorinikab Juda, ak eng’ betusiekab Jeroboam weritab Joas, laitoriatab Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye kingong’alale Jehovah Hosea eng’ tai, kolenji Jehovah Hosea, Ui imutyige chepkugoniot koek osotiondeng’ung’, ak lagokab kugoinatet: amu yaei emet kugoinatet ne o, kometoi Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwa anyun kotun Gomer cheptab Diblaim; ak kimanach, ak kisikyi inendet werit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jehovah inendet, Kuure kainennyi Jesreel; amu tomo ne matia, si kayaakta mugetut agobo gorotikab Jesreel, eng’ gotab Jeu, ak agesu bounatetab gotab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak tun airie kwangetab Israel eng’ atebwetab Jesreel eng’ betunoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimanach kogeny, ak kosich chepto. Ak kolenji Jehovah inendet, Kuure kainennyi Lo-ruhama: amu ma arire gotab Israel, anyochini kaat eng’ kiy age tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago arire gotab Juda, ak asorune ichek eutab Jehovah Kamuktaindenywa, amasoru eng’ kwanget, anan eng’ rotwetab chok, anan eng’ luget, anan eng’ mbartanyisiek, anan eng’ bik che lanyei mbartanyisiek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoluge Lo-ruhama, komanach kogeny, ak kosich werit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Jehovah, Kuure kainennyi Lo-ami: amu ma o bikyuk, amaegu Kamuktaindeng’wong’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Arorutiet agobo kaweegunetab bik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago tenitu lagokab Israel ng’aniek che bo nyanjet, che magimuchi kirogendoe kiy anan kiit; ak eng’ ole kigimwachine icheget kele, Ma o bikyuk, ko tun kilenjin, O werikab Kamuktaindet ne sobei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyum lagokab Juda ak lagokab Israel, ak kolewenjigei kandoindet agenge, ak kotogosta eng’ emonoto: amu egu betut ne o betutab Jesreel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
